# Opt-level stability marker for 312-checked-arithmetic.ax.
#
# The fixture's header claims every term answers the same at --opt 0,
# 1, 2 and 3, which is the property the raw operators cannot claim and
# the reason the checked ones exist. run-stdlib-tests.sh holds it:
# with this file beside the case, the same stdout and exit must answer
# at all four levels. Empty of configuration by design - presence is
# the whole claim - so this comment is the only thing in it.
